// Spec: language-ref.md > CStructs
//
// The internal representation. Internal packages define their own types and
// never use the surface's types — that keeps the surface/internal dependency
// one-way.
//
// `_` in the declaration-name position means "derive the name from the
// filename", so this declares `Origin`.

_ co.cstruct = {
    x co.int32;
    y co.int32;
}
